?q1 Which environment variable should you set if you only want errors (and not panics) to include backtraces?
  = RUST_LIB_BACKTRACE=1
  > README.md:85 #e2e2fa1521f8
?q2 What is Backtrace defined as when the "std" feature is not enabled?
  = An empty enum (enum Backtrace {})
